---
// SmartThrottlingCard.astro - Core Web Vitals & Traffic Quality Optimization Card
---

<div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-xs dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/80 sm:p-8 space-y-6">
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4 dark:border-slate-800">
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>⚡</span> Smart Ads Throttling &amp; Core Web Vitals Protection
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5">
        Protect your Google Search rankings, improve page load speed (LCP/INP), and stop layout shift (CLS).
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Master Throttling Switch -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Smart Engine</span>
      <label class="relative inline-flex items-center cursor-pointer">
        <input
          type="checkbox"
          id="field-throttling-enabled"
          role="switch"
          checked
          class="sr-only peer"
        />
        <div
          class="w-11 h-6 bg-slate-300 rounded-full peer peer-checked:after:translate-x-full peer-checked:after:border-white after:content-[''] after:absolute after:top-0.5 after:left-0.5 after:bg-white after:border-slate-300 after:border after:rounded-full after:h-5 after:w-5 after:transition-all peer-checked:bg-indigo-600 dark:bg-slate-700"
        ></div>
      </label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs">
    <!-- 1. Slow Connection Shield -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/60 p-4 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-950/40 space-y-2">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>📶</span> 2G &amp; Data-Saver Shield
        </span>
        <input type="checkbox" id="field-throttle-slow-conn" checked class="rounded text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
        Automatically omits heavy third-party ad scripts when visitors are on 2G, slow 3G, or have browser <em>Save-Data</em> enabled.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. Lazy Loading Margin -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/60 p-4 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-950/40 space-y-2">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>👁️</span> Lazy Load Ad Units
        </span>
        <input type="checkbox" id="field-throttle-lazy" checked class="rounded text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
        Only loads and requests ads when user scrolls within 300px of the slot (IntersectionObserver), saving CPU and initial bytes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. Mobile Ad Limit -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/60 p-4 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-950/40 space-y-2">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>📱</span> Mobile Ad Density Cap
        </span>
        <select id="field-throttle-mobile-max" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          <option value="1">Max 1 Ad</option>
          <option value="2" selected>Max 2 Ads (Recommended)</option>
          <option value="3">Max 3 Ads</option>
          <option value="0">Unlimited</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
        Prevents screen clutter on mobile phones by limiting maximum simultaneously loaded advertisements.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4. CLS Height Reservation -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/60 p-4 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-950/40 space-y-2">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>📐</span> Zero Layout Shift (CLS)
        </span>
        <input type="checkbox" id="field-throttle-cls" checked class="rounded text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
        Enforces min-height placeholders before ads load so the page doesn't jump, keeping Google CLS score in the green.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
